menu "P1S Heat Controller Board"

config P1S_RELAY_ACTIVE_LOW
    bool "Relay channels are active low"
    default y
    help
        Most two-channel opto-isolated relay boards energize a channel when its
        control input is driven low. Keep this enabled for those boards so the
        pins idle inactive through reset. Disable it only for relay boards that
        energize on a high input.

endmenu
